flowchart TD
    Q[Question already exists] --> R[Retrieval\nagent / consultant / human]
    R --> I[Intake Gate\natomic · falsifiable · scoped · time-bounded]
    I -->|FAIL| D[Decomposition draft]
    D --> H1[Human selects / reframes]
    H1 --> S1[STOP]
    I -->|PASS| M[Claim Match\nEXACT · ISOMORPHIC · PARTIAL · NONE]
    M -->|EXACT / validated ISOMORPHIC| P[Public Stop-Point\nstate · supports · does_not_support\nas_of · freshness · depth · applicability]
    M -->|PARTIAL| PP[Return public boundary\n+ unresolved portion]
    M -->|NONE| N[No public evidence answer]
    P --> SU{Fresh + sufficient?}
    SU -->|YES| C[CITE AND STOP]
    SU -->|NO| E[Minimum Missing Evidence]
    PP --> E
    E --> L[RDL candidate\nL0 / L1 / L2 / L3]
    L --> V[Verification Quote\nscope · envelope · cutoff · stop condition · cap]
    V --> A[Human Authorization + Payment]
    A --> PC[Paid Cycle\nprocess bought · outcome not bought]
    PC --> ER[Result / Evidence]
    ER --> PE{Publication Eligibility}
    PE -->|PUBLIC| HR[Human Publication Review]
    PE -->|PRIVATE| DM[Customer Decision Memory]
    PE -->|MIXED| MX[Redact / Split]
    HR --> NV[New Public Stop-Point Version\nappend-only]
    NV --> CH[changes.json]
    CH --> RE[Agent Reuse]
